#: f0e9528c420b43298dd9a2f79fefa7af
msgid "基函数"
msgstr "Basis Functions"

#: 2227730088c84cb6a0cc0c73749419f3
msgid "使用伯恩斯坦多项式计算径向基函数。"
msgstr "Computes radial basis functions using Bernstein polynomials."

#: 3004066c6fac45a0b944613f0c210be7
msgid ""
"这种基函数利用伯恩斯坦多项式作为基底，将距离 `r` 映射到 `num_basis_functions` 维 "
"的特征空间。为了数值稳定性，计算过程在对数空间中进行。"
msgstr "This basis function uses Bernstein polynomials as a basis to map the distance `r` to a feature space of `num_basis_functions` dimensions. For numerical stability, the calculation is performed in logarithmic space."

#: afb28451cf924abfa00d095f4d5e5893
msgid "原始的伯恩斯坦基函数定义为: B_v,n(x) = C(n,v) * x^v * (1-x)^(n-v) 其中 x = r / cutoff。"
msgstr "The original Bernstein basis function is defined as: B_v,n(x) = C(n,v) * x^v * (1-x)^(n-v) where x = r / cutoff."

#: 7a99258a21e34f3480f82f9db93c6fcc
msgid ""
"为了避免当 x 接近 0 或 1 时可能出现的数值下溢，本实现计算其对数： log(B_v,n(x)) = log(C(n,v)) + "
"v*log(x) + (n-v)*log(1-x) 并利用 `torch.log(-torch.expm1(log(x)))` 来精确计算 "
"`log(1-x)`。"
msgstr "To avoid numerical underflow when x is close to 0 or 1, this implementation calculates its logarithm: log(B_v,n(x)) = log(C(n,v)) + v*log(x) + (n-v)*log(1-x) and uses `torch.log(-torch.expm1(log(x)))` to accurately compute `log(1-x)`."

#: daa682108c4040688928ca21406eb826
msgid "基函数的数量，即输出向量的维度。"
msgstr "The number of basis functions, i.e., the dimension of the output vector."

#: 03c9142273534f58a2013b86545c67c1 09755a23a1f6443ba17d04b12ed73fcb
#: 2405f934d8604aaea943803b8d75d809 241e875809ac48e6ab8aeaaa1fef6780
