#: c9338991d9744292afa0bad158e04167
msgid "torch.Tensor"
msgstr "torch.Tensor"

#: eaf2fb12d5ef4368a8702558d62e548c
msgid "预计算的对数化二项式系数 log(C(n,v))。"
msgstr "Precomputed logarithmic binomial coefficients log(C(n,v))."

#: 3ddbad25ffa44ce1a60125d0b5d0dd09
msgid "伯恩斯坦多项式的次数 n = N-1-v，其中 N 是基函数数量。"
msgstr "The degree of the Bernstein polynomial n = N-1-v, where N is the number of basis functions."

#: 54c501dac24f47c5879bb263ce920c0d
msgid "伯恩斯坦多项式的索引 v。"
msgstr "The index v of the Bernstein polynomial."

#: 0e26186df0ea49dcba625bc5e7f41a4b e35692729a15479b8beb795c057ce19a
msgid "此基函数没有可训练参数，因此该方法为空。"
msgstr "This basis function has no trainable parameters, so this method is empty."

#: 118c0868c7fd44fea6403336f420fae7 4991270ccc0340ceb771f4105d7347c1
#: 4cc292ba96f54d858da6e622879a9ba7 63aa692cb2f1406f99a1a75bb363436a
#: ac92824e959d4f87b5ce05a53d0517c4
msgid "计算给定距离 `r` 的径向基函数值。"
msgstr "Computes the radial basis function values for a given distance `r`."

#: 494493bd28f64a259b14a6367a76afdd
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Args"

#: d3ac2fc70f3449e79cb2f8df324a12e8
msgid "原子间距离张量，形状为 (N_interactions, 1)。"
msgstr "Tensor of interatomic distances, with shape (N_interactions, 1)."

#: b40ab01bd7aa4a159b3244b6bf522987
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: 6a91131bec964295b964d1d88099e9a0
msgid "径向基函数的值，形状为 (N_interactions, num_basis_functions)。"
msgstr "The values of the radial basis functions, with shape (N_interactions, num_basis_functions)."

#: 0cbb1ab4f344477c998a4f60b1adf337 2cbe4c3611eb4e40940d0c3b3cdbdc50
#: 482b024c8ad24ce0b9c802fbe0371edf b1c6564556fe4f029582a4f151228fc2
#: b3ad74ca864542a8833a3522f863ba03
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: a5852b23b3ee4988b9828e964a4f0a3c
msgid "使用指数缩放的伯恩斯坦多项式计算径向基函数。"
msgstr "Computes radial basis functions using exponentially scaled Bernstein polynomials."

#: 84c2eb537a1547c5ad30c826e1f4f117
msgid "该变体在标准的伯恩斯坦基函数上引入了一个可学习的指数衰减因子 `alpha`。 这使得基函数能够更好地适应不同尺度上的相互作用。"
msgstr "This variant introduces a learnable exponential decay factor `alpha` to the standard Bernstein basis functions. This allows the basis functions to better adapt to interactions at different scales."

#: 81a700640e7d45278b482546977d99dd
msgid ""
"基函数的变量从 `x = r / cutoff` 替换为 `x = exp(-alpha * r)`。 参数 `alpha` 通过 "
"`softplus` 函数保证其为正值。"
msgstr "The variable of the basis function is replaced from `x = r / cutoff` to `x = exp(-alpha * r)`. The parameter `alpha` is ensured to be positive through the `softplus` function."

#: 0f2863702ac247d0810d97173bd06f1e 6bf4487d151d43829f47142effb68cc8
#: d453bdece1ac426dac17fd710527af87
msgid "基函数的数量。"
msgstr "The number of basis functions."

#: 9d017c47bff34745bcf55c9f86f11c53 9dbcdcc2e2964158ac6c0a43147361d2
#: d43bd2a7083847698a1046dcbc0dbc64
msgid "截断半径。"
msgstr "The cutoff radius."

#: 82902f19b3914be49d4bfb1f9d0d7875
msgid "可训练的衰减系数（softplus之前）。"
msgstr "The trainable decay coefficient (before softplus)."

#: 3dc446d171f9479c85ff4e60618fe9bc 67958b15bce948f9a0872e8f5f786666
#: b8bd91a007984250976070abd069c2df
msgid "nn.Parameter"
msgstr "nn.Parameter"

#: f25f3afa42ef44989976350055a9029b
msgid "使用 softplus 的逆函数来初始化 `_alpha`，使其 softplus 后的值等于 `ini_alpha`。"
msgstr "Initializes `_alpha` using the inverse of the softplus function, so that its value after softplus equals `ini_alpha`."

#: 19382070fd8a4bd3ad085307faf9b7f1 1c0959093049423595dc9feac5d6afcb
#: 60734064cf624eca808c331bf45cbea0 c80bdd7e9d5948d8a5d56496436de737
msgid ":sphinx_autodoc_typehints_type:`\\:py\\:class\\:\\`\\~torch.Tensor\\``"
msgstr ":sphinx_autodoc_typehints_type:`\\:py\\:class\\:\\`\\~torch.Tensor\\``"

#: d71e8c5462d14b36b983532dc5a01ee6
msgid "使用指数缩放的高斯函数计算径向基函数。"
msgstr "Computes radial basis functions using exponentially scaled Gaussian functions."

#: e756b13b45a6433f998f95bb39d00d72
msgid ""
"这种基函数由一组高斯函数构成，其中心点在指数空间上均匀分布。 具体来说，中心点位于 `exp(-alpha*r)` 的空间中，而不是直接在 `r`"
" 上。 这允许基函数在靠近原子核（r较小）的地方分布得更密集。"
msgstr "This basis function consists of a set of Gaussian functions whose centers are uniformly distributed in an exponential space. Specifically, the centers are located in the space of `exp(-alpha*r)` rather than directly on `r`. This allows the basis functions to be more densely distributed near the atomic nucleus (where r is small)."

#: 1abf28ef4be64ca8915288477915ebb2
msgid "高斯函数的中心点，在 [1, 0] 区间内线性分布。"
msgstr "The centers of the Gaussian functions, linearly distributed in the interval [1, 0]."

#: 5a156a3b55e249238bdffc8453288d3f cda67f894c51469c934b881ef80520e6
msgid "高斯函数的宽度。"
msgstr "The width of the Gaussian functions."

#: 23c3e86e4da84ccc89b1020b70d6b167
msgid "可训练的指数衰减系数。"
msgstr "The trainable exponential decay coefficient."

#: 524490b631ab40be9771268e43962fb5 5413b8432f6c421c88ebf3ec1af295b3
msgid "初始化 `_alpha` 参数。"
msgstr "Initializes the `_alpha` parameter."

#: 53220b68cb7d44b7977792e04aa5d8c6
msgid "使用标准高斯函数计算径向基函数。"
msgstr "Computes radial basis functions using standard Gaussian functions."

#: 20b745c6713041bda3fed49ee16f6a31
msgid "这是最常见的一种径向基函数，由一组在距离空间 `r` 上均匀分布的高斯函数构成。"
msgstr "This is the most common type of radial basis function, consisting of a set of Gaussian functions uniformly distributed in the distance space `r`."

#: b0ca6e9607674a15b52539c0804831fa
msgid "高斯函数的中心点，在 [0, cutoff] 区间内线性分布。"
msgstr "The centers of the Gaussian functions, linearly distributed in the interval [0, cutoff]."

#: 8436aaf95ded48fe83beb2c6ba714e2b
msgid "一个伪参数，仅为兼容性存在，不起实际作用。"
msgstr "A pseudo-parameter that exists only for compatibility and has no actual effect."

#: 298e76ba4b6f40d684c2a5b016918974
msgid "使用一种重叠变体的伯恩斯坦多项式计算径向基函数。"
msgstr "Computes radial basis functions using an overlap variant of Bernstein polynomials."

#: 1a8380caff8d453aab7a36e4d63bdb6f
msgid "与指数伯恩斯坦基函数类似，但也引入了一个可学习的参数 `alpha`，但其 对距离 `r` 的变换方式不同，旨在更好地描述原子轨道的重叠积分。"
msgstr "Similar to the exponential Bernstein basis functions, it also introduces a learnable parameter `alpha`, but its transformation of the distance `r` is different, aiming to better describe the overlap integrals of atomic orbitals."

#: fd16037303234060965a24d986ebbd77
msgid "变量替换为 `x = log(1 + alpha*r) - alpha*r`。"
msgstr "The variable is replaced with `x = log(1 + alpha*r) - alpha*r`."